  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Smart Home Automation\r\n\r\n1. Choose one rule:\r\n   - The lights turn on only if motion is detected **AND** it is nighttime.\r\n   - The lights turn on if motion is detected **OR** it is nighttime.\r\n2. Complete the truth table using the rule you chose.\r\n3. Use the table to build your flowchart.\r\n4. Include all 4 outcomes—one for each case in your table.\r\n5. Save your flowchart to your Backpack.\r\n\r\n",
